{"id":2275,"date":"2024-09-19T12:33:00","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:33:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2275"},"modified":"2025-10-02T11:52:33","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T11:52:33","slug":"cardboard-boxes-for-jewellery","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-for-jewellery\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Boxes For Jewellery"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"34\">Cardboard Boxes For Jewellery Options<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"404\">Cardboard Boxes for Jewellery are designed to keep delicate items safe while presenting them in an elegant and organized manner. These boxes provide protection for rings, necklaces, bracelets, and earrings while maintaining a clean and professional look. Available in different sizes and styles, they can be customized to suit branding needs or personal preferences.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"702\">At <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"464\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a>, we supply <strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"516\">Custom Cardboard Boxes for Jewellery<\/strong> at wholesale prices. Whether you need them for retail, shipping, or gifting purposes, our boxes are made with durable board materials that ensure strength without compromising design.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"707\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"756\">Inserts for better presentation and safety<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"1181\">A key feature of jewellery packaging is the use of inserts. Inserts prevent items from shifting and help them stay organized inside the box. Our <strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"993\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-box-inserts\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"991\">Cardboard Box Inserts<\/a><\/strong> provide an effective solution for separating multiple pieces or adding protective cushioning. By combining jewellery boxes with inserts, brands can enhance both safety and presentation.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"2833\">\n<thead data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1425\">\n<tr data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1425\">\n<th data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1307\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Options Available<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Finishing Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1425\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Applications<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"2833\">\n<tr data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1823\">\n<td data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1658\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Styles<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Two-piece, Hinged lid, Drawer, Foldable<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1737\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Premium Cardboard, Kraft, SBS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1773\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1823\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rings, Necklaces, Bracelets, Earrings<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"2025\">\n<td data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1857\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Small, Medium, Large, Custom Dimensions<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1937\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rigid Board, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1974\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foil Stamping, Embossing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2025\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail display, Gift packaging, Storage<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2227\">\n<td data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inserts and Compartments<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2106\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foam, Velvet, Cardboard dividers<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Die-cut and Custom Shapes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2176\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft-touch or Plain finishes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2227\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Multi-piece sets, Safe handling<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2429\">\n<td data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printing Options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2308\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CMYK, Pantone, Logo branding, Full print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Digital and Offset printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2378\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Raised Ink, Metallic foils<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2429\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Branding, Promotional jewellery boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2631\">\n<td data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Durability and Strength<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Single, Double, or Reinforced Walls<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2543\" data-col-size=\"sm\">FSC Certified Boards<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2580\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Laminated or Uncoated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2631\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Shipping jewellery safely<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2833\">\n<td data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2665\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eco-Friendly Options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2712\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recyclable and biodegradable available<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2745\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft and Recycled Materials<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte eco-lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sustainable jewellery packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2838\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2878\">Benefits of using jewellery boxes<\/h2>\n<ol data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"3160\">\n<li data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2944\">\n<p data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2944\">Keeps delicate jewellery safe during shipping and handling.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2997\">\n<p data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2997\">Provides an elegant display for retail shelves.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3050\">\n<p data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3050\">Custom sizes ensure every piece fits perfectly.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3103\">\n<p data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3103\">Inserts protect against scratches and tangling.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3160\">\n<p data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3160\">Supports branding with print and finishing options.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3165\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3211\">Broader uses within packaging solutions<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3602\">Cardboard jewellery boxes are part of a larger family of specialized packaging. Businesses often explore the <strong data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3445\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3443\">Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/a><\/strong> to find variations designed for different industries. This allows flexibility in choosing boxes meant for gifts, shipping, cosmetics, and beyond.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3707\">Order your <strong data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3674\">Cardboard Boxes For Jewellery<\/strong> today at Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3905\">\n<li data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3759\">\n<p data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3759\">Choose from Gloss, Matte, or Spot UV coatings.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3809\">\n<p data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3809\">Free design support available for all orders.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3855\">\n<p data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3855\">Custom sizes and bulk quantities offered.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3905\">\n<p data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3905\">Fast turnaround and free nationwide shipping.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"4055\">Whether for retail jewellery shops, personal use, or bulk supply, our cardboard jewellery boxes ensure quality, safety, and style in one solution.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for Jewellery &#8211; your one-stop solution for premium packaging.<span class=\"animating\"> We offer a wide range of cardboard boxes at wholesale prices,<\/span> designed to showcase your exquisite jewellery pieces. Experience fast turnaround times and the highest quality materials and printing techniques. Make your jewellery stand out with our exceptional packaging solutions. Contact us.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2406,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2275","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Custom Cardboard Boxes For Jewellery Pa